# Keep the Cloud Build upload lean: the Dockerfile only needs web/,
# hero_engine.py, and data/hero_realms_cards.json. Everything else just
# slows the upload (Cloud Build gives 120 free build-minutes per day).
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/
tools/
archive/
docs/
models_value/
*.log
*.md
!CLOUD_RUN.md
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/public/cards/*.jpg
hero_realms_gui.py
hero_rl_*.py
hero_selfplay.py
hero_mcts_bench.py
hero_benchmark.py
